* ^List-Id: .* <compsoc-announce.warwickcompsoc.co.uk>
list/compsoc-announce/

:0
* ^List-Id: .* <compsoc-discuss.warwickcompsoc.co.uk>
list/compsoc-discuss/

:0
* ^List-Id: Open Rights Group
list/openrightsgroup/

:0
* ^List-Id: .* <theora.xiph.org>
list/theora/

:0
* ^List-Id: .* <developers-public.lists.mysociety.org>
list/mysociety-developers/

