:0
* ^List-Id: XMPP Security <security.xmpp.org>
list/xmpp-security/

:0
* ^List-Id: XMPP Jingle <jingle.xmpp.org>
list/xmpp-jingle/

:0
* ^From: .* <.*@slackware.com>
inbox/

####################
## Spam Filtering ##
####################
:0:
* ^X-Spam-Flag: YES
spam/

#:0 fw
#| sb_filter.py

:0:
* ^X-SpamBayes-Classification: spam
spam/

:0:
* ^X-SpamBayes-Classification: unsure
unsure/

#########################
## Post-Spam Filtering ##
#########################

# This has to be here so it is checked by SpamBayes first.
# The other compsoc mailing lists don't have to be
#   checked because they require registration and hence
#   receive fewer, if any, spam messages.
:0
* ^List-Id: .* <compsoc-techteam.warwickcompsoc.co.uk>
list/compsoc-techteam/
